✅ ✅ 1–10 BASIC / CORE
1. Git checkout fails

Root cause: Wrong branch (master vs main)
Fix: Specify correct branch
Best practice: Always define branch in pipeline


2. Stage skipped

Root cause: when condition false
Fix: Validate parameter/condition
Best practice: Log param values


3. Parameters not used correctly

Root: Wrong reference (params.ENV)
Fix: Use params.<name>
Best: Validate with echo


4. Declarative vs Scripted

Declarative → structured, easy
Scripted → flexible, complex logic
Use declarative unless dynamic need


5. Run pipeline on specific branch

Use:
when { branch 'main' }
Best: Combine with multibranch pipeline


6. Environment variables

Use environment {} OR env.VAR
Best: Centralize env variables


7. Secrets handling

Use Jenkins credentials
Avoid hardcoding
Use withCredentials


8. Continue after failure

Use:
post { always {} }
Or catchError


9. Retry failed stage

Use:
retry(3)


10. Trigger pipeline

Manual → UI
Auto → webhook / cron
Best: Use webhook for CI


✅ ✅ 11–15 GIT
11. Webhook not working

Root: Wrong webhook URL / firewall
Fix: Verify Git → Jenkins connection
Best: Enable logs in Git plugin


12. Build only main

Use:
branch 'main'


13. Old code building

Root: workspace cache
Fix:
cleanWs()
Best: always clean workspace


14. Git credentials issue

Root: wrong credential type
Fix: use correct SSH/API token


15. Private repo clone

Use Jenkins credentials
Best: SSH over HTTPS


✅ ✅ 16–20 DOCKER
16. Docker fails in Jenkins

Root: environment mismatch
Fix: check Dockerfile paths


17. docker.sock permission

Fix:
usermod -aG docker jenkins


18. Slow build

Use layer caching
Multi-stage builds


19. Dynamic tag

Use:
${BUILD_NUMBER} or ${GIT_COMMIT}


20. Clean images

Use:
docker system prune -f


✅ ✅ 21–25 AWS ECR
21. No basic auth credentials

Root: login failed
Fix: run ECR login step


22. Cross-account ECR fails

Root: trust policy / STS missing
Fix: validate assume role


23. IAM role vs access key

Role = secure (temporary) ✅
Access key = risky ❌


24. Wrong region

Root: mismatch
Fix: align region


25. Push to multiple repos

Loop:
for repo in repos
docker push




